{"name": "My Tennis Apocalypse", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Explosive Tennis Matches</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">My Tennis Apocalypse is a roguelike tennis game, where you win matches in explosions instead of points. Drain your opponent's health to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"646\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/6603919ee9cb7d78b56916c605af60d3.poster.avif?t=1783940185\" width=\"1146\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/6603919ee9cb7d78b56916c605af60d3.webm?t=1783940185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/6603919ee9cb7d78b56916c605af60d3.mp4?t=1783940185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gather Power-ups</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All weapons are allowed in the matches. Challenge your opponent by gathering and using a set of randomly generated items &amp; power-ups.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"646\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/310fb4ea99230442aea7137d857ce501.poster.avif?t=1783940185\" width=\"1146\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/310fb4ea99230442aea7137d857ce501.webm?t=1783940185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/310fb4ea99230442aea7137d857ce501.mp4?t=1783940185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Overworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Practice your skills, buy new items and get tips from NPCs in the overworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"646\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/42b795001a8c51d3bf3b5343f00814d2.poster.avif?t=1783940185\" width=\"1146\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/42b795001a8c51d3bf3b5343f00814d2.webm?t=1783940185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/42b795001a8c51d3bf3b5343f00814d2.mp4?t=1783940185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Navigate the Competition Ladder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A procedurally generated competition ladder is generated for you each time you play. Choose your next opponent wisely to get a leg up in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"646\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/b2be5ebdb07d17799c167bf5fd346232.poster.avif?t=1783940185\" width=\"1146\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/b2be5ebdb07d17799c167bf5fd346232.webm?t=1783940185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/extras/b2be5ebdb07d17799c167bf5fd346232.mp4?t=1783940185\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Play explosive tennis in My Tennis Apocalypse, where the last one standing wins! Each run is unique in this action roguelike sports game as you face opponents with the help of versatile and flashy powerups, spicing up the classic tennis formula.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238490/e96c858870c644b053008a2099fd6b492ae03cc0/header.jpg?t=1783940185", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Sports", "Tennis", "Roguelite", "Arcade", "Cartoony"], "developers": "Dappal Interactive Oy", "publishers": "Dappal Interactive Oy", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4238490", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "25 March 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ewC_ysJ57Fc", "first_seen": 1774396800.0}